    "updated_at": "2023-09-13T08:26:54Z",
    "body": "I don't necessarily disagree, but also https://github.com/whatwg/url/issues/370 had like no demand in a period of five years whereas other URL API features were repeatedly requested over that same time period. Given that we have finite time, I'm not sure I'd invest it here.",
